# Client credentials — contains 27 third-party client logos and award
# claims that have not been cleared for publication. See TBD.md → B1, B2.
creds/

# Archived third-party source. Kept locally for study; republishing another
# company's HTML/CSS in a public repo is not ours to do. Our own written
# analysis (reference/trionn/*.md) IS committed.
reference/trionn/html/

# Harsh's GLOBAL Claude setup — 544 files, 13MB. It predates this project and
# is not project code. It also vendors ~500 third-party agent skills whose
# licences are not ours to redistribute from a public repo.
# Our project tooling lives in .claude/ and skills/{README,routing,agents,
# mcps,hooks,workflows} — those ARE committed.
skills/Setup/

